// title: M365 Copilot Extensions Threat Monitoring
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Cloud Apps
// tables: CloudAppEvents, ThreatIntelligenceIndicator
// purpose: M365 Copilot Extensions Threat Monitoring
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/M365%20Copilot%20Extensions%20Threat%20Monitoring.kql
